---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Docker Cheat Sheet | Free Containers, Compose & Networking Reference"
  description="Complete Docker cheat sheet with containers, compose, networking, volumes, and multi-stage builds. Free reference for DevOps engineers."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Docker<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Containers, compose, networking, volumes, and multi-stage builds. From basics to production Docker.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Container Basics</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Run &amp; Manage</h3>
        <pre><code>docker run -d -p 8080&#58;80 nginx
docker ps                         # running
docker ps -a                      # all
docker stop container_id
docker rm container_id
docker exec -it container /bin/sh</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Images</h3>
        <pre><code>docker build -t myapp&#58;1.0 .
docker images                     # list
docker rmi myapp&#58;1.0
docker tag myapp&#58;1.0 repo/myapp&#58;latest
docker push repo/myapp&#58;latest
docker pull repo/myapp&#58;latest</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Dockerfile Best Practices</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Multi-Stage Build</h3>
        <pre><code>FROM node&#58;20 AS builder
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json .
RUN npm ci
COPY . .
RUN npm run build

FROM node&#58;20-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY --from=builder /app/dist ./dist
CMD ["node", "dist/server.js"]</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>.dockerignore</h3>
        <pre><code>node_modules
.git
*.md
.env
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
dist
coverage</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Volumes &amp; Persistence</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Volume Commands</h3>
        <pre><code># Named volume
docker volume create mydata
docker run -v mydata&#58;/app/data nginx

# Bind mount
docker run -v $(pwd)/src&#58;/app/src nginx

# Read-only
docker run -v mydata&#58;/data&#58;ro nginx

docker volume ls
docker volume rm mydata</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Docker Compose Volumes</h3>
        <pre><code>services&#58;
  db&#58;
    image&#58; postgres&#58;16
    volumes&#58;
      - pgdata&#58;/var/lib/postgresql/data
      - ./init.sql&#58;/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/init.sql

volumes&#58;
  pgdata&#58;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Networking</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Port Mapping</h3>
        <pre><code>docker run -p 8080&#58;80 nginx
docker run -p 127.0.0.1&#58;3000&#58;3000 app
docker run --expose 8080 app

docker port container_id
docker inspect container_id | grep -A5 IPAddress</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Container Networking</h3>
        <pre><code>docker network create mynet
docker network ls
docker run --network mynet --name api app
docker run --network mynet db

# Containers communicate by name
# ping api from db container</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Docker Compose</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Compose File</h3>
        <pre><code>services&#58;
  web&#58;
    build&#58; .
    ports&#58; ["3000&#58;3000"]
    environment&#58;
      - DATABASE_URL=postgres&#58;//db&#58;5432/app
    depends_on&#58;
      - db
  db&#58;
    image&#58; postgres&#58;16
    environment&#58;
      POSTGRES_DB&#58; app
    volumes&#58;
      - pgdata&#58;/var/lib/postgresql/data</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Compose Commands</h3>
        <pre><code>docker compose up -d
docker compose down
docker compose ps
docker compose logs -f web
docker compose exec web sh
docker compose build --no-cache
docker compose pull</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
